  "body": "**Original comment by agriggio (Bitbucket: [agriggio](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio), GitHub: [agriggio](https://github.com/agriggio)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nART supports DNG files created by HDRmerge \\(at least the master version, I’m not sure about 1.12.1 as I fixed some issues in the meantime\\). You can integrate HDRmerge in ART using [user commands](https://bitbucket.org/agriggio/art/wiki/Usercommands). Here’s an example configuration file that I’m using:\n\n```\n[ART UserCommand]\n\nLabel=HDRmerge\nCommand=/opt/hdrmerge/bin/hdrmerge\n\nMinArgs=2\nFileType=raw\nMatchCamera=true\nMatchLens=true\nMatchAperture=true\nMatchFocalLen=true\n```\n\nHTH\n",
